{"id":"destin","lemma":"destin","pos":"noun","rank":1057,"glosses":["destiny, fate"],"ipa":"/dɛs.tɛ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/64/Fr-destin.ogg/Fr-destin.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"destins"},"formAudio":{"destins":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/09/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-destins.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je crois au destin.","en":"I believe in fate.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to believe","l":"croire"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"C'est mon destin.","en":"This is my fate.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Il a mon destin entre ses mains.","en":"He has my fate in his hands.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"between"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"hand","l":"main"}]},{"text":"Peut-être était-ce le destin.","en":"Maybe it was fate.","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Votre destin est scellé.","en":"Your fate is sealed.","words":[{"g":"your, belonging to you"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to seal","l":"sceller"}]}]}